sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant WebApp as Flask WebApp (webapp/app.py)
    participant Pipeline as NLP Pipeline (src/pipeline.py)
    participant ToxicBERT as toxic-bert Model
    participant Aspects as Hybrid Aspect Finder
    participant Sentiment as DistilBERT v3 ABSA
    participant Ollama as Local Ollama (llama3.1)

    Student->>WebApp: Enters feedback text & clicks Submit
    WebApp->>Pipeline: POST /api/analyse (text, facility)
    Pipeline->>ToxicBERT: Evaluate toxicity score (threshold >= 0.50)
    alt Comment is Abusive (score >= 0.50)
        ToxicBERT-->>Pipeline: is_abusive = True (score: 0.99)
        Pipeline-->>WebApp: Flagged abusive status
        WebApp-->>Student: Displays RED Quarantine Alert (Excluded from ratings, 0 stars)
    else Comment is Safe (score < 0.50)
        ToxicBERT-->>Pipeline: is_abusive = False (score: 0.002)
        Pipeline->>Aspects: extract_aspects(text, facility)
        Aspects-->>Pipeline: List of [{category, aspect_term, clause}]
        loop For each detected aspect
            Pipeline->>Sentiment: predict_sentiment(clause, aspect_term)
            Sentiment-->>Pipeline: Polarity ("positive", "neutral", "negative")
        end
        Pipeline-->>WebApp: Aggregated aspect-sentiment records
        WebApp->>Ollama: POST /api/summarize-live (aspects summary prompt)
        Ollama-->>WebApp: 2-3 sentence natural language factual summary
        WebApp-->>Student: Displays Result Table, Star Ratings, Sentiment Badges & Summary
    end
